# Configure these in the host's environment. Never put credentials in tool arguments.
# Optional absolute path to share data across DSH, MCP and the standalone panel.
# RESUME_AGENT_HOME=C:/path/private-resume-data
# RESUME_SMTP_ADDRESS=your-address@qq.com
# RESUME_SMTP_CODE=your-authorization-code
# RESUME_SMTP_PROVIDER=qq
# Real sending additionally requires RESUME_ALLOW_SEND=1 and a user confirmation in the native DSH card / local panel, or a one-use CLI approval.
